@startuml
!include style.iuml
' PDF report: ReportsPage -> POST /api/analytics/exams/{examId}/report (AnalyticsController, Roles
' Admin,SuperAdmin,Teacher), ExamAccessService.DenyUnlessAsync(Owner), AnalyticsService.GetExamSummaryAsync
' + GenerateExamReportPdfAsync (QuestPDF; file in Reports/, row in ExamReports), GET /api/analytics/exams/{examId}/reports,
' GET /api/analytics/reports/{fileName} (bare name 400, no row 404, not owner 403, file missing 404). The summary PDF is
' not audited; the Module 12 exports (POST /api/analytics/reports/{type}) are audited as REPORT_GENERATED with the
' file's SHA-256 (ReportExportService).
' Printed pt = fontSize * 72 * printed_width_in / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 28
skinparam ArrowFontSize 27
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 29
}
|Staff (ReportsPage)|
start
:Teacher (exam owner),
Admin or SuperAdmin
selects an exam and
clicks Generate New
Report: POST /api
/analytics/exams
/{examId}/report;
|Server|
if (DenyUnlessAsync(Owner):\nexam exists, caller is its\nowner, Admin or SuperAdmin?) then ([no])
  :404 or 403;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
:AnalyticsService.GetExamSummaryAsync:
marks = override, else AI suggestion,
score buckets, per-question averages,
violation counts;
:QuestPDF document: Summary Statistics,
Per-Question Performance, Score Distribution;
:Write Exam_Report_...pdf to Reports, insert
an ExamReports row (ReportType = ExamSummary,
GeneratedBy, FilePath), return downloadUrl;
note right
  Not audited. The exports
  (POST /reports/{type}:
  attendance, violations,
  scores, excel, evidence-zip)
  are audited as REPORT_
  GENERATED + SHA-256.
end note
|Staff (ReportsPage)|
:Reload the history
(GET .../reports),
then Download: GET
/api/analytics/reports
/{fileName};
|Server|
if (Bare file name, row in\nExamReports, caller owner?) then ([yes])
  :Return the PDF
  (application/pdf);
else ([no])
  :400, 404
  or 403;
endif
stop
@enduml
